* Edit 3: Add second common-source stage (NM2) for gain multiplication
* Two-stage amplifier multiplies gains of NM1 and NM2.
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n0 VSS
L L2 n2 n3
C C2 n3 VOUT1
NMOS NM2 n3 n4 n5 VSS
L L3 n4 VDD
C C3 n5 VSS
R R1 VDD n6
NMOS NM3 n6 n6 VSS VSS
R R2 n6 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS